<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Qantas stewards in wages deal - official.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Qantas stewards in wages deal - official.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The union negotiating for airline attendants, the largest group of workers at Qantas Airways Ltd, said on Friday it had reached an in-principle wages agreement with the company for the next two years.</p>
<p>&quot;We're just waiting for an exchange of documents,&quot; Flight Attendants Association of Australia (FAAA) Federal Secretary Lance Webb told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;It's sufficient to say that that should lead to an in-principle agreement,&quot; Webb said after the completion of day of negotiations with Qantas officials.</p>
</text>
